  "description": "OKOHOP crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C108 H96 Gd8 N32 O44,2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd7 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd8 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.932-3.994 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 109.35-116.94°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Gd8(L)8(CO3)4(H2O)8·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
